{"3704080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Plague Genesis", "steam_appid": 3704080, "required_age": "17", "is_free": false, "dlc": [4775790], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOMETHING IS WRONG IN THIS FOREST.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an accident in a remote region, Peter and Erick must find a way out before the night gets even worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there are things in that forest that shouldn’t be there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And they all seem to point to the same name: GENOCYTE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704080/extras/7c27bac7a4aede0f9828bfb628d6eba5.poster.avif?t=1788012416\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704080/extras/7c27bac7a4aede0f9828bfb628d6eba5.webm?t=1788012416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704080/extras/7c27bac7a4aede0f9828bfb628d6eba5.mp4?t=1788012416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DON’T HIDE. REACT.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plague Genesis</strong> blends horror, exploration, and close-range combat into a dark, cinematic 2D pixel art experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face creatures up close, manage your stamina, dodge attacks, and find openings to counterattack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That doesn’t mean you should feel safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704080/extras/678bea0697b50275101afdc53311d7c4.poster.avif?t=1788012416\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704080/extras/678bea0697b50275101afdc53311d7c4.webm?t=1788012416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704080/extras/678bea0697b50275101afdc53311d7c4.mp4?t=1788012416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY STEP LEADS TO SOMETHING WORSE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore rain-soaked forests, abandoned places, and areas marked by the presence of the mysterious Genocyte.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find survivors, gather resources, and slowly uncover what happened in the region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some creatures attack without thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Others seem to know exactly what they’re doing.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704080/extras/196757df31c2a9573f578911550118a9.poster.avif?t=1788012416\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704080/extras/196757df31c2a9573f578911550118a9.webm?t=1788012416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704080/extras/196757df31c2a9573f578911550118a9.mp4?t=1788012416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAGUE GENESIS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horror. Brutal combat. Exploration. Mystery.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And maybe discover why it began.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOMETHING IS WRONG IN THIS FOREST.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an accident in 